     also specify the destination label in _/_e_t_c_/_p_p_p_/_p_p_p_._c_o_n_f to use.  It must
     contain the “set ifaddr” command to {define} the remote peers IP address.
     (refer to _/_u_s_r_/_s_h_a_r_e_/_e_x_a_m_p_l_e_s_/_p_p_p_/_p_p_p_._c_o_n_f_._s_a_m_p_l_e)

